# line 267 `migrate_data(.., host: ExtHostConfig, ..)` and line 319 `boot(.., host: ExtHostConfig, ..)` -> `host: ExtHostConfigs`.
# line 274 `ExtHostPool::new(host)` -> `crate::compose::ext_host_pool(host)` (same error mapping). The migration's pool is
# routed like the core's, so its docx/pdf extraction reads natively with no Node worker started.
